cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this guide or this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rendering neurons: a guide to rendering connectomic reconstructions with AI"
abstract: >-
  The procedure and the code behind neuron renders of mouse hippocampus (CA3),
  the fly brain and nerve cord (BANC), mouse visual cortex (MICrONS) and mouse
  retina (Eyewire II): download, decimation, Blender import, material and
  lighting conventions, animation, a shared overnight render queue, review and
  publishing, plus a path that needs no GPU.
authors:
  - family-names: Sterling
    given-names: Amy
repository-code: "https://github.com/amyleesterling/render"
url: "https://github.com/amyleesterling/render"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-04"
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - neuron rendering
  - Blender
  - scientific visualisation
  - CAVE
